From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Heinemeier Hansson <david@heinemeierhansson.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:11:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] phy: qcom: qmp-combo: Start Type-C mode-switch PHYs in
 USB3-only mode

A combo PHY with a Type-C mode-switch currently starts in QMPPHY_MODE_USB3DP
at probe time. On Qualcomm laptops where dwc3-qcom enumerates a USB-C boot
stick at SuperSpeed before SOCCP/ADSP attaches and brings up pmic_glink,
the first Type-C notification for that USB-only stick requests
QMPPHY_MODE_USB3_ONLY.

Because QMPPHY_MODE_USB3_ONLY != QMPPHY_MODE_USB3DP,
qmp_combo_typec_mux_set() calls qmp_combo_reconfigure_phy() roughly 20 ms
after SOCCP/ADSP attaches, tearing down the live SuperSpeed link under the
enumerated USB drive. On SanDisk USB-C UAS drives (0781:55fd) on the ASUS
Zenbook A16 (UX3607OA, Glymur), this triggers stat urb -71, a 5-second
uas_pre_reset timeout, capacity drop to 0, U1 LPM failure, and a full
SuperSpeed device reset right during archiso medium discovery.

DisplayPort Alternate Mode on a Type-C mode-switch port cannot operate
until pmic_glink_altmode / UCSI selects a DP state through
typec_mux_set() anyway, which switches the PHY to DP_ONLY or USB3DP and
runs dp_aux_init(). Starting mode-switch PHYs in QMPPHY_MODE_USB3_ONLY (and
skipping dp_aux_init() in qmp_combo_dp_init() while in USB3-only mode, as
qmp_combo_reconfigure_phy() already does) makes the initial USB-only
Type-C notification a no-op so live SuperSpeed USB-C links stay intact.
Ports with only orientation-switch (no mode-switch) keep QMPPHY_MODE_USB3DP.
---
 drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c b/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
index c23d131..7ce0e7c 100644
--- a/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
+++ b/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
@@ -4464,7 +4464,9 @@ static int qmp_combo_dp_init(struct phy *phy)
 	if (ret)
 		goto out_unlock;
 
-	cfg->dp_aux_init(qmp);
+	if (qmp->qmpphy_mode == QMPPHY_MODE_USB3DP ||
+	    qmp->qmpphy_mode == QMPPHY_MODE_DP_ONLY)
+		cfg->dp_aux_init(qmp);
 
 	qmp->dp_init_count++;
 
@@ -6108,6 +6110,8 @@ static int qmp_combo_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 
 	if (of_property_present(dev->of_node, "mode-switch") ||
 	    of_property_present(dev->of_node, "orientation-switch")) {
+		if (of_property_present(dev->of_node, "mode-switch"))
+			qmp->qmpphy_mode = QMPPHY_MODE_USB3_ONLY;
 		ret = qmp_combo_typec_register(qmp);
 		if (ret)
 			goto err_node_put;
